  "description": "The Hayati Pro Ultra Plus 25K Prefilled Pod Kit is a dual-flavour, high-capacity vape device designed for extended use and everyday simplicity. Built to deliver up to 25,000 puffs from a single device, it houses two prefilled 2ml pods and a built-in 10ml refill reservoir that automatically tops up each pod to maintain consistent flavour. Switching between flavours is as simple as twisting the mouthpiece. This clever design lets you enjoy two flavours from one device without fuss, and the dual-pod layout helps prolong usage by alternating between coils. Each pod connects to the 10ml internal reservoir, allowing the device to keep both pods topped up without needing to refill manually. The device features a digital display that shows battery status, puff count and e-liquid level at a glance. Powered by an 850mAh rechargeable battery with USB-C charging, the Pro Ultra Plus 25K supports long-lasting sessions between top-ups. It’s inhale-activated and ready to use straight out of the box, with two prefilled pods included in every kit. With its refill reservoir, dual-flavour setup, and generous puff capacity, the Hayati Pro Ultra Plus 25000 offers a practical alternative to traditional single-use devices—without compromising on flavour or ease of use. Hayati Pro Ultra Plus 25000 Kit Flavours • Blue Razz Cherry Sharp Blue Raspberry with rich, juicy Cherry. • Blue Razz GB Blue Raspberry meets nostalgic Grape Bubblegum. • Blue Sour Raspberry Sour confectionery-style Raspberry with an electric tang. • Blueberry Raspberry A sweet and tart mixed Berry blend. • Fresh Mint Clean, cooling Mint with no frills. • Blue Razz A sweet and tangy Blue Raspberry flavour with a slightly fizzy twist. • Blackcurrant Cotton K Tangy Blackcurrant meets a soft cotton candy sweetness. • Cherry Berry A vibrant mix of rich Cherry and bright mixed Berries. • H’Bubba Classic sweet Bubblegum flavour. • Lemon & Lime A crisp citrus twist of Lemon and Lime. • Mr Blue Mixed Berry mystery with a cooling finish. • Raspberry Cola Fizzy Cola with a fruity Raspberry edge. • Strawberry Raspberry Ice Icy blend of Strawberry and Raspberry. • Strawberry Watermelon A classic summer combination. • Summer Dream A bright fruit cocktail with a refreshing lift. Dual Flavour Kits: • Blackcurrant Cotton K / Blue Raspberry Tangy Blackcurrant with sweet Cotton Candy spun sugar and juicy Blue Raspberry. • Blueberry Cotton K / Raspberry Cotton K A blend of Candy Floss spun sugar and Berry. • Grape GB / Strawberry GB Grape and Strawberry Bubblegum classics. • Kiwi Banana / Straw’ Banana Exotic Kiwi-Banana and creamy Strawberry-Banana. • Straw’ Cranberry Cherry / Cherry Ice Sharp Strawberry, Cranberry and Cherry mix with menthol twist. • Straw’ Grapefruit / Straw’ Dragonfruit Strawberry with citrus Grapefruit and exotic Dragonfruit. • Straw’ Guava / Dragon Berries Creamy Guava paired with sweet Dragonfruit and Berry mix. Shop Hayati Pro Ultra Plus 25000 Refill Pods",
